{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在TVB節目《夫妻的博弈》中，除了郭柏妍的「綠茶」演出，飾演富家千金葉熙妍的游嘉欣（游游）同樣成為焦點！游游曾表示這次拍劇猶如行時裝騷，劇中她連環換上多套靚衫，完美駕馭各種風格，其百變造型驚艷網民，更獲讚演技大有進步，成功演活了這位豪爽又可愛的千金小姐。</p><p>游嘉欣上演個人時裝騷 連環換裝勁吸睛</p><p>游嘉欣在劇中的造型確實百變，上周以高貴公主Look登場已讓網民眼前一亮。在昨晚一集中，她更連換多套服裝，包括幹練的黑色OL套裝、胸前有大蝴蝶結的可愛水手Look，以及舒適的家居休閒服。當中，一套白色毛毛背心搭配胸前金屬蝴蝶結別針的打扮最為吸睛，集優雅、型格及可愛於一身。而所有造型的下身均以「短打」上陣，盡情展現她的青春本錢，令觀眾目不暇給。</p><p>游嘉欣演活富家千金 鬥寸郭柏妍獲讚</p><p>游嘉欣的演出成功將豪爽又不失可愛的角色演得入型入格，特別是她與郭柏妍飾演的雪文激烈對立，兩人鬥寸的場面火花四濺，被網民大讚非常有趣。游游一輪嘴講對白的功力亦備受肯定，不少觀眾認為她演繹得非常自然，完全沒有煩厭感，反而更突顯了角色的直率個性，與郭柏妍的「綠茶」心機形成強烈對比。</p><p>網民洗版式稱讚：演技越來越進步</p><p>對於游嘉欣在劇中的表現，網民給予了極高評價，紛紛在網上洗版留言。大部分留言都稱讚她的演技進步神速：「游嘉欣演技越來越進步」、「太可愛了」。同時，她的百變造型也大受歡迎：「咩造型都咁靚」、「靚女一輪嘴講嘢唔煩厭」。更有網民特別提到她與郭柏妍的對手戲，大讚：「佢同郭柏妍互寸好似真嘅一樣。」</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01_18056336306a7ac3517778d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02_11262628106a7ac35416bb6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/03_6127112136a7ac357ec0eb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04_12160524096a7ac35c037de.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/05_7550571626a7ac35fb2ce2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/06_4071612876a7ac362f16e3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/07_15456018466a7ac3662dec7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/08_354906576a7ac36930f60.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/09_14935232266a7ac36c5b457.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_17874266766a7ac36f80fc6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_4086022196a7ac373d199b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_15757961986a7ac377082d8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_3381421456a7ac379d1f47.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_1821150946a7ac37cda691.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_2475935966a7ac38051f75.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_12862129286a7ac3842b85b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_16696532046a7ac3881b53a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_16539855866a7ac38b7193b.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_19255660406a7ac38ec8af7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_11249806516a7ac392557c2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_12345695856a7ac39589233.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/30_7790301656a7ac398ae160.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_16731493276a7ac39c7c177.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_13430595756a7ac3a0028aa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/33_20266618776a7ac3a3bd7ee.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/34_7328662636a7ac3a76358a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/35_19829359906a7ac3aa57dd3.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/36_5089193996a7ac3add15e0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/37_7362479116a7ac3b10b590.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/38_3366883816a7ac3b438127.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/39_17735589136a7ac3b94acf2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/40_15384515526a7ac3bdd90e0.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？</p><p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了 香港演唱會2025一覽 ，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p><p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？</p><p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的 親子好去處 、拍拖推介32大 情侶好去處 、落雨必去的 室內好去處 、慶生推薦20大 生日好去處 、新手必備19大靚景 行山好去處 、秋天戶外 露營好去處 …..</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-11T06:58:58.724771+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":913,"images":32,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}